---
description: Benchmarks are generated in MetaMetro, without hardcoded paths, mocks, or target leakage
alwaysApply: true
---

# Benchmarks

Do not add a new benchmark or pinned community in this repository. Add it in MetaMetro with `metametro benchbuild` and open a pull request there.

Do not hard-code machine paths. Read the MetaMetro bench directory, a CLI argument, or an environment variable. If the path is missing, stop.

Do not mock a benchmark graph, a taxonomy label, or a metric. A graph that exists only inside a test file stays there.

Do not write the evaluation target into features, colours, or another model input. Ground truth stays in `ground_truth/` and is read only by the scorer.

Strong100 and other prebuilt bundles are not benchmarks to port.
